<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 8 }}>EVOLUTION</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 16 }}>模型演进：R1 → V3 → V4-Flash，蒸馏是捷径</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, marginBottom: 42 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 6, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        {[
          { t: 'R1', y: '2025.01', d: '思维链推理 · 对标 OpenAI o1' },
          { t: 'V3', y: '2025.11', d: 'MoE 架构 · 671B / 37B 激活' },
          { t: 'V4-Flash', y: '2026.07', d: '小参数反超 · 1M 上下文' },
        ].map((item, idx) => (
          <Box key={idx} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px', marginBottom: 10, boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 118 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 3 }}>{item.t}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#22D3EE', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{item.y}</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{item.d}</Text>
          </Box>
        ))}

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 20px' }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 8 }}>
            <FAIcon name='graduation-cap' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 25, height: 25 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>知识蒸馏 = 「老师教学生」</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            大模型（老师）训练出小模型（学生），学生继承能力、降低硬件门槛——这就是普通用户也能本地跑的原因。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 5, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 16, justifyContent: 'center', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Image
          src='assets/knowledge_distillation.png'
          style={{ width: '100%', height: 340, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 12, marginBottom: 16 }}
        />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>能力被「教」给小模型</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>发光知识由教师传给学生，轻量芯片代表更低的本地部署门槛。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: 'calc(100% - 120px)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 2 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>07 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
